# Security

Consolidated pointers — read the linked rules/skills for detail.

| Topic | Rule / doc |
| ----- | ---------- |
| PHI in logs, Sentry, AI | `phi-data-safety.mdc` |
| AI assistant tiers, confirm cards | `ai-assistant-safety.mdc`, `docs/architecture/ai-clinic-assistant.md` |
| Clinic RBAC | `docs/mvp.md` §6.11, `fastapi-jwt-auth` skill |
| JWT auth | `app/core/security.py` — access + refresh, membership re-check per request |
| Clinic scoping | Never trust client `clinic_id`; scope via `X-Clinic-Id` + membership row |
| Prod deploy guard | `no-prod-deploy.mdc` (unlock: **deskwave**) |
| Audit trail | `audit-logging` skill — `activity_log` on mutations |

Inactive `clinic_memberships` must fail auth even if JWT is unexpired.
